<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon on instrument cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon on instrument cos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it reiterated its strong buy rating on Thermo Electron Corp and initiated coverage of several affiliated instrument companies.</p>
<p>-- said started ThermoQuest Corp as a strong buy and Thermo Instrument Systems Inc as a buy.  </p>
<p>-- said started Thermo Voltek Corp, Thermo Sentron Inc, Thermo BioAnalysis Corp, ThermoSpectra Corp, Thermo Optek Corp and Thermedics Detection Inc with hold ratings.</p>
</text>
